              "kind": "account_code",
              "code_from": "1200"
            }
          ],
          "legal_reference": "Schedule 3A places called-up share capital not paid inside debtors, as item B.II.5; the United Kingdom format prints it as item A at the head of the balance sheet, and this is one of the places where the two formats differ."
        },
